      "requiredSeconds": 7.088,
      "slackSeconds": 4.912,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S02",
      "id": "S02",
      "text": "智学闭环 LearnRise，把建赛、资料、知识库、笔记、出题、复习、助手和排行榜，串成一条完整的学习流水线。八个环节，共用同一份数据。",
      "textHash": "8bbd6f4c5e0643b3",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s02.mp3",
      "duration": 12.888,
      "durationSeconds": 12.888,
      "frames": 411,
      "audioFrames": 387,
      "windowFrames": 600,
      "windowSeconds": 20,
      "characters": 67,
      "charsPerSecond": 5.2,
      "requiredSeconds": 13.688,
      "slackSeconds": 6.312,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S03",
      "id": "S03",
      "text": "第一步，上传。PDF、Word、Markdown，甚至拍照的讲义，都能直接进来。系统会自动 OCR、按标题分块、向量化，并实时告诉你：排队、解析、嵌入、就绪。你看到的不是上传进度，是一份资料正在变成可检索的知识。",
      "textHash": "2f127885839b5e65",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s03.mp3",
      "duration": 21.024,
      "durationSeconds": 21.024,
      "frames": 655,
      "audioFrames": 631,
      "windowFrames": 720,
      "windowSeconds": 24,
      "characters": 105,
      "charsPerSecond": 4.99,
      "requiredSeconds": 21.824,
      "slackSeconds": 2.176,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S04",
      "id": "S04",
      "text": "解析完成后，它会生成一棵知识树：章节、知识点、层级关系一目了然。每个知识点都绑定原文切片，点开就能看到出处。笔记可以编辑，思维导图随资料结构自动生长。你甚至可以手动补一张复习卡，把老师的口头重点也留下来。",
      "textHash": "2a6d8fe6a4ee2d92",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s04.mp3",
      "duration": 20.28,
      "durationSeconds": 20.28,
      "frames": 633,
      "audioFrames": 609,
      "windowFrames": 720,
      "windowSeconds": 24,
      "characters": 102,
      "charsPerSecond": 5.03,
      "requiredSeconds": 21.08,
      "slackSeconds": 2.92,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S05",
      "id": "S05",
      "text": "接下来是最关键的一步：出题。选定知识点，AI 会先在你的资料里检索最相关的三段原文，再据此生成题目。答错时，它不只告诉你正确答案，还会把错因定位到原文的哪一页、哪一句。每一道错题，都会自动进入复习队列。",
      "textHash": "a7c9661be0d8c839",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s05.mp3",
      "duration": 19.608,
      "durationSeconds": 19.608,
      "frames": 613,
      "audioFrames": 589,
      "windowFrames": 780,
      "windowSeconds": 26,
      "characters": 100,
      "charsPerSecond": 5.1,
      "requiredSeconds": 20.408,
      "slackSeconds": 5.592,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S06",
      "id": "S06",
      "text": "遇到不懂的地方，可以进入苏格拉底模式。它不直接给答案，而是一步步追问，直到你自己想明白；想不通，再点揭晓。讲解以流式输出，第一个字几乎立刻出现，不用盯着转圈。你还可以为它配置不同的模型和人格。",
      "textHash": "614c729022b92692",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s06.mp3",
      "duration": 18.528,
      "durationSeconds": 18.528,
      "frames": 580,
      "audioFrames": 556,
      "windowFrames": 720,
      "windowSeconds": 24,
      "characters": 96,
      "charsPerSecond": 5.18,
      "requiredSeconds": 19.328,
      "slackSeconds": 4.672,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S07",
      "id": "S07",
      "text": "陪练模式会把薄弱知识点变成一场连续对话。系统根据你的作答，找出真正的薄弱点，生成补救计划。临近考试，还可以一键生成备考计划，把时间分配到每一天。",
      "textHash": "b8f6f0dfbf5264c0",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s07.mp3",
      "duration": 14.784,
      "durationSeconds": 14.784,
      "frames": 468,
      "audioFrames": 444,
      "windowFrames": 660,
      "windowSeconds": 22,
      "characters": 72,
      "charsPerSecond": 4.87,
      "requiredSeconds": 15.584,
      "slackSeconds": 6.416,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S08",
      "id": "S08",
      "text": "复习不是简单重复。每张卡片都有难度和稳定性，系统用 DSR 模型计算下一次出现的时间。评分一到五，间隔从一天到一年，自动调整。邮件提醒可在设置里开关。",
      "textHash": "bd5b6bb83f4f8a81",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s08.mp3",
      "duration": 15.6,
      "durationSeconds": 15.6,
      "frames": 492,
      "audioFrames": 468,
      "windowFrames": 600,
      "windowSeconds": 20,
      "characters": 73,
      "charsPerSecond": 4.68,
      "requiredSeconds": 16.4,
      "slackSeconds": 3.6,
      "fits": true
    },
    {
      "scene": "S09",
      "id": "S09",
      "text": "学习也可以是一个人的事，但一群人走得更远。创建竞赛、邀请队友、一起刷题，排行榜自动计分，刷新后更新。学习看板把到期量、掌握度、热力图和遗忘曲线放在同一屏。",
      "textHash": "3e4242e9c6498e78",
      "audio": "out/audio/yunyang/s09.mp3",
      "duration": 15.84,
      "durationSeconds": 15.84,
      "frames": 500,
